   "id": "e94",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 84,
   "y": 1246.0,
   "width": 131.04000000000002,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "Authorino\n  mcp-authz-policy\n  AUTHENTICATION",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Authorino\n  mcp-authz-policy\n  AUTHENTICATION",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 753305,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 9951255,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "id": "e95",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 372,
   "y": 1245.0,
   "width": 524.1600000000001,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "anonymous                 when !headers.exists(h, h == \"x-mcp-toolname\")\nwaterplant-<user> (JWT)   when  headers.exists(h, h == \"x-mcp-toolname\")\n-> validates signature, iss and aud against the realm",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "anonymous                 when !headers.exists(h, h == \"x-mcp-toolname\")\nwaterplant-<user> (JWT)   when  headers.exists(h, h == \"x-mcp-toolname\")\n-> validates signature, iss and aud against the realm",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 761224,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 10055984,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "id": "e96",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1342,
   "y": 1245.0,
   "width": 444.08000000000004,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "Authorino's authentication rules are OR-ed, so the two `when`\nclauses make them exclusive: handshake traffic stays\nanonymous, and only real tool calls must carry a token.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Authorino's authentication rules are OR-ed, so the two `when`\nclauses make them exclusive: handshake traffic stays\nanonymous, and only real tool calls must carry a token.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
