   "y": 1337.5,
   "width": 400.40000000000003,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "Predicate 1: may this human do this, right now.\nPredicate 2: is the caller the attested agent.\nNeither alone is sufficient \u2014 that is the intersection.",
