   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Predicate 1: may this human do this, right now.\nPredicate 2: is the caller the attested agent.\nNeither alone is sufficient \u2014 that is the intersection.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
