   "x": 62,
   "y": 1763.5,
   "width": 331.52000000000004,
   "height": 20.0,
   "text": "The three transformations that matter",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The three transformations that matter",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1062146,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 14035686,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "id": "e134",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 62,
   "y": 1797.5,
   "width": 925.1200000000001,
   "height": 70.0,
   "text": "1.  NOTHING becomes A HUMAN.  Steps 1-2 carry no identity at all; the operator becomes a real subject only at step 10.\n2.  A SECRET becomes AN ATTESTED WORKLOAD.  Steps 5-9 replace \"knows a string\" with \"is this pod\" -- twice, two SVIDs.\n3.  EIGHTEEN PERMISSIONS become ONE.  Step 10 intersects the human's roles with what the agent may be delegated, then\n    narrows to the single tool in flight. Steps 13-14 only check what is already there.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1.  NOTHING becomes A HUMAN.  Steps 1-2 carry no identity at all; the operator becomes a real subject only at step 10.\n2.  A SECRET becomes AN ATTESTED WORKLOAD.  Steps 5-9 replace \"knows a string\" with \"is this pod\" -- twice, two SVIDs.\n3.  EIGHTEEN PERMISSIONS become ONE.  Step 10 intersects the human's roles with what the agent may be delegated, then\n    narrows to the single tool in flight. Steps 13-14 only check what is already there.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
